1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,004
Little Bear loved the whole day.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,958
It was only the dark he did not love.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:15,079
Every night it waited in the cave, a big scribble with no face.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,413
But tonight the dark was not empty. It was only unfinished.

5
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,071
A little light appeared, one scribble at a time, always one step ahead.

6
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,200
So he followed it.

7
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,908
The dark had colours in it, like everything else.

8
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,624
And Little Bear slept very well.
